{"ref":"BDB, גְּדַלְיָה","hw":"גְּדַלְיָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדַלְיָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>Yah is great</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  governor of Judea appointed by Nebuchadnezzar <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.5\">Je 40:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.16\">41:16</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  son of Amariah, a son of Hezekiah <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:1\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.1\">Zp 1:1</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  priest of the sons of Jeshua <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:18\" href=\"/Ezra.10.18\">Ezr 10:18</a>.","next":"BDB, גְּדַלְיָ֫הוּ","prev":"BDB, גִּדֵּל"}